Marcus F User Stories:

User Story 1:

As a Customer
I want a shared quiz for a group
So that I can create quick quizes for all my students

Given a shared database for multiple users to draw quizes from
When creating a quiz, be able to share it with others
Then multiple users can take the same quiz

User Story 2:

As a Supplier
I want a product that can be sold quickly and efficiently
So that it can be distributed quickly and with minimum cost

Acceptance Criteria
Given a product with clear documentation and deployment options
When I list the product on digital marketplaces or deliver it to clients
Then the setup and onboarding process should be streamlined, requiring minimal post launch support and enabling rapid adoption by customers

User Story 3:

As a User
I want to save my completed quizzes
So that I can review my performance over time

Acceptance Criteria
Given I finish a quiz
When I click "Save Results"
Then my answers and scores are stored and viewable in my account history

User Story 4:

As a User
I want instant feedback after answering each question
So that I can learn from my mistakes right away

Acceptance Criteria
Given a submitted answer
When I complete a question and click "Submit"
Then the bot should show whether my answer was correct, and display the correct answer if I was wrong

User Story 5: 

As a Student
I want to choose the difficulty level of my quiz
So that I can test myself at the appropriate challenge level

Acceptance Criteria
Given a list of difficulty options (e.g., Easy, Medium, Hard)
When I select a difficulty level before generating a quiz
Then the AI should generate questions suited to that level

Tim
1. As a student, I want to be able to see the time it takes for me to answer questions, so that I can improve my speed.
    Acceptance Criteria:
        Given I have completed a quiz.
        When I review my results.
        Then I can see the time it took to answer each question.

2. As a student, I want to be able to review past quizzes and their results, so that I can track my learning progress.
    Acceptance Criteria:
        Given I have taken past quizzes,
        When I view the quiz history,
        Then I can see past quizzes and results.
3. As a student, I want to receive AI-generated summaries of complex topics within the study material, so that I can quickly grasp key concepts.
    Acceptance Criteria:
        Given I have uploaded study materials,
        When I request a summary,
        Then the AI generates a concise summary.
4. As a student, I want to receive personalized feedback and recommendations based on my quiz performance, so that I know what to focus on.
    Acceptance Criteria:
        Given my quiz results are available,
        When I view my feedback,
        Then I see specific recommendations and learning strategies.
5. As a student, I want to be able to bookmark specific questions for later review, so that I can create a personalized study guide.
    Acceptance Criteria:
        Given I am viewing a quiz question,
        When I click the bookmark button,
        Then the question is saved to my bookmarks.

